# Allowlist strategy (same as claude-config): ignore everything, re-include
# only canonical content. This also covers machine state the installer writes
# into an installed root (opencode.json, .doppler-initialized), which is why
# there is no per-clone .git/info/exclude handling.
/*

# --- tracked: the package ---
!.gitignore
!LICENSE
!package.json
!install.sh
!AGENTS.md
!hooks/
!policy/
!bin/
!opencode/
!test/
!tsconfig.json
!README.md

# --- noise to drop even inside tracked dirs ---
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules/
package-lock.json
